      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.12,
          "end": 5.85,
          "en": "So now that we did add environment variables",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.85,
          "end": 8.15,
          "en": "before we get to deployment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.15,
          "end": 11.69,
          "en": "it's time to do a test build on our local machine",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.69,
          "end": 13.81,
          "en": "and see if we're happy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.81,
          "end": 16.45,
          "en": "And for this, I opened the terminal again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.45,
          "end": 18.82,
          "en": "and now when I wanna run this build command",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.82,
          "end": 22.34,
          "en": "which builds our application for production.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.34,
          "end": 24.25,
          "en": "And if you run NPM run build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.25,
          "end": 27.74,
          "en": "this production optimized build is being produced.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.74,
          "end": 31.93,
          "en": "And we also get useful information shown to us here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.93,
          "end": 36.13,
          "en": "We see, for example, which pages are built for the server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.13,
          "end": 39.41,
          "en": "which pages are 100% static,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.41,
          "end": 41.27,
          "en": "this with the empty.here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.27,
          "end": 43.52,
          "en": "and which pages are dynamic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.52,
          "end": 46.76,
          "en": "but were statically pre-generated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.76,
          "end": 49.63,
          "en": "And we see that output here and that's all looking good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.63,
          "end": 52.597,
          "en": "We got the starting page pre-generated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.597,
          "end": 56.25,
          "en": "our 404 was added for us automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.25,
          "end": 58.81,
          "en": "Contact page is 100% static",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.81,
          "end": 61.8,
          "en": "because we don't fetch any dynamic data here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.8,
          "end": 65.17,
          "en": "And then we got posts and deposed detail pages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.17,
          "end": 67.363,
          "en": "which were also pre-generated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.48,
          "end": 70.96000000000001,
          "en": "But here we see an issue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.96000000000001,
          "end": 74.96000000000001,
          "en": "This is red because this posts detailed page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.96000000000001,
          "end": 77.17,
          "en": "These pages are too big,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.17,
          "end": 80.42,
          "en": "they contain too much JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.42,
          "end": 83.62,
          "en": "We could deploy it, it wouldn't break",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.62,
          "end": 85.47,
          "en": "but this is a clear indicator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.47,
          "end": 88.84,
          "en": "that we might be doing something in those pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.84,
          "end": 90.5,
          "en": "which is not optimal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.5,
          "end": 93.25999999999999,
          "en": "We might be shipping too much code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.25999999999999,
          "end": 94.87,
          "en": "And very often that means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.87,
          "end": 97.56,
          "en": "that you're using some third party package,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.56,
          "end": 100.83,
          "en": "some third party library that is too big.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.83,
          "end": 103.42,
          "en": "So therefore, before we deploy something,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.42,
          "end": 105.53999999999999,
          "en": "let's fix this issue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 105.53999999999999,
          "end": 109.03,
          "en": "And for this, let's have a look at the detail page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 109.03,
          "end": 112.93,
          "en": "Now this slag page here is certainly not too big.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.93,
          "end": 115.25999999999999,
          "en": "It doesn't have a lot of code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 115.25999999999999,
          "end": 118.06,
          "en": "We also can ignore any code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 118.06,
          "end": 122.83,
          "en": "which is only needed in getStaticProps or getStaticPaths.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 122.83,
          "end": 126.71,
          "en": "That code will only execute during the build process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 126.71,
          "end": 128.88,
          "en": "and on the server anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.88,
          "end": 131.33,
          "en": "That will never end up on the client",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.33,
          "end": 136.32999999999998,
          "en": "and the code here this size refers to the client side code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 137,
          "end": 139.51,
          "en": "So we can't ignore the server side code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 139.51,
          "end": 141.62,
          "en": "So this component should be fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 141.62,
          "end": 144.603,
          "en": "Therefore, let's explore the post content component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 145.48,
          "end": 149.09,
          "en": "Here, we all don't have too much code on our own",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 149.09,
          "end": 153.72,
          "en": "but we are using a couple of third party packages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 153.72,
          "end": 157.653,
          "en": "react markdown, and this syntax highlighter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 158.49,
          "end": 161.81,
          "en": "And now you would have to dig into those packages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 161.81,
          "end": 164.15,
          "en": "and find out how big they are.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.15,
          "end": 167.44,
          "en": "And I can tell you that our problem here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 167.44,
          "end": 169.9,
          "en": "is react syntax highlighter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 169.9,
          "end": 172.12,
          "en": "This is huge.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 172.12,
          "end": 177.12,
          "en": "If you visit the react syntax highlighter GitHub repository,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 177.15,
          "end": 178.85,
          "en": "then you actually find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 178.85,
          "end": 181.6,
          "en": "that they tell you that it's quite big",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.6,
          "end": 184.06,
          "en": "and that they offer a light build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.06,
          "end": 187.12,
          "en": "because the react syntax highlighter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.12,
          "end": 189.793,
          "en": "can have a very large footprint.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 191.21,
          "end": 194.42,
          "en": "But the solution is simple, we can use the light build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.42,
          "end": 197.5,
          "en": "basically as it is described down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 197.5,
          "end": 199.84,
          "en": "The difference between the light version",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 199.84,
          "end": 201.64,
          "en": "and the version we're currently using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 201.64,
          "end": 204.02,
          "en": "is that this version out of the box",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.02,
          "end": 206.19,
          "en": "supports syntax highlighting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 206.19,
          "end": 210.02,
          "en": "for all possible programming languages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 210.02,
          "end": 213.47,
          "en": "That might sound nice, but it is quite redundant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 213.47,
          "end": 216.28,
          "en": "and it adds a lot of JavaScript code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 216.28,
          "end": 218.01,
          "en": "In reality,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 218.01,
          "end": 223.01,
          "en": "we are probably not going to include C++ code snippets here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 223.95,
          "end": 227.21,
          "en": "if we are blogging about web development.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 227.21,
          "end": 229.23,
          "en": "And hence using the light build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 229.23,
          "end": 233.09,
          "en": "and explicitly stating the languages we wanna support",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 233.09,
          "end": 235.8,
          "en": "is probably the better choice here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 235.8,
          "end": 237.4,
          "en": "And that's what we can do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 237.4,
          "end": 242.223,
          "en": "We can also import the styling in a slightly optimized way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 243.4,
          "end": 248.4,
          "en": "So therefore what I'll do here is I'll import PrismLight",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.46,
          "end": 251.14,
          "en": "as Syntax Highlighter, instead of prism",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 252.29,
          "end": 255.16,
          "en": "and I'll import my styles differently",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 255.16,
          "end": 259.63,
          "en": "by diving into style/prism/atom-dark",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 259.63,
          "end": 263.03,
          "en": "and then importing atomDark like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 263.03,
          "end": 266.13,
          "en": "This will also only import that style then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 266.13,
          "end": 267.64300000000003,
          "en": "and no other styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 268.56,
          "end": 270.91,
          "en": "And now we need to import the languages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 270.91,
          "end": 272.75,
          "en": "which we wanna support.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 272.75,
          "end": 274.69,
          "en": "And we do this by importing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 274.69,
          "end": 279.69,
          "en": "from react-syntax-highlighter/ dist/cjs/languages/prism/",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 283.97,
          "end": 285.51,
          "en": "and then we have different options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 285.51,
          "end": 287.783,
          "en": "like JavaScript for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 288.77,
          "end": 293.77,
          "en": "And then we could import this as js, whatever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 294.35,
          "end": 296.96,
          "en": "And we could, of course also duplicate this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 296.96,
          "end": 297.793,
          "en": "And for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 297.793,
          "end": 302.1,
          "en": "all the import css if we wanna support this as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 302.1,
          "end": 304.72,
          "en": "And you can simply add all the languages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 304.72,
          "end": 306.16,
          "en": "you wanna support.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 306.16,
          "end": 308.46,
          "en": "So all the languages which you'll use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 308.46,
          "end": 310.423,
          "en": "in your code snippets typically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 311.38,
          "end": 314.39,
          "en": "Then you just need to register those languages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 314.39,
          "end": 318.96,
          "en": "simply by calling SyntaxHighlighter.registerLanguage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 318.96,
          "end": 323.04,
          "en": "and then the identifier, for example js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 323.04,
          "end": 324.23,
          "en": "that's the identifier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 324.23,
          "end": 328.703,
          "en": "which I also use in my markdown code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 329.86,
          "end": 332.89300000000003,
          "en": "So we need to import that identifier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 334.12,
          "end": 338.83,
          "en": "And then as a second argument, that imported language",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 339.83,
          "end": 343.38,
          "en": "and I'll repeat that for css here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 343.38,
          "end": 347.223,
          "en": "And with that, we should have a much lighter footprint.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 348.58,
          "end": 352.96,
          "en": "If we now run NPM run build again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 352.96,
          "end": 356.75,
          "en": "with those changes applied, it will build our site again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 356.75,
          "end": 359.35,
          "en": "and produce all those files again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 359.35,
          "end": 363.28,
          "en": "And now we'll see that this is much smaller.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 363.28,
          "end": 368.28,
          "en": "It shrank from 320 kilobytes to 114 kilobytes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 369.52,
          "end": 371.105,
          "en": "And it's also worth noting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 371.105,
          "end": 375.23,
          "en": "that these sizes are before compression,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 375.23,
          "end": 378.61,
          "en": "but Node.js will compress these files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 378.61,
          "end": 382.14,
          "en": "So once they are served, they are much smaller",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 382.14,
          "end": 384.15,
          "en": "and therefore that should be fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 384.15,
          "end": 387.16,
          "en": "Now let's also test if that looks good though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 387.16,
          "end": 389.12,
          "en": "So let's start the def server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 389.12,
          "end": 392.27,
          "en": "to see if our change has broke something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 392.27,
          "end": 394.09000000000003,
          "en": "and go to Posts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 394.09000000000003,
          "end": 397.02,
          "en": "and then that post, which has that code snippet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 397.02,
          "end": 400.683,
          "en": "and that still looks all right here if we have a look at it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 401.69,
          "end": 403.64,
          "en": "So that is working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 403.64,
          "end": 405.98,
          "en": "Now we have that syntax highlighting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 405.98,
          "end": 408.72,
          "en": "but with a smaller footprint.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 408.72,
          "end": 411.92,
          "en": "And that's why checks like this are important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 411.92,
          "end": 414.76,
          "en": "and why you should always validate your code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 414.76,
          "end": 416.87,
          "en": "and see if you can improve it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 416.87,
          "end": 420.64,
          "en": "And even here you might find over third-party packages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 420.64,
          "end": 422.82,
          "en": "which have a even smaller footprint.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 422.82,
          "end": 426.8,
          "en": "You might find different ways of highlighting syntax.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 426.8,
